  sources:
  - name: IPCC AR6 WG1 SPM Table SPM.2 remaining carbon budgets
    authority: Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC) -- Working Group
      I
    url: https://www.ipcc.ch/report/ar6/wg1/chapter/summary-for-policymakers/
    description: 'Estimated remaining CO2 budgets from 1 January 2020 for limiting
      global warming to 1.5, 1.7 and 2.0 °C above 1850-1900 at 17, 33, 50, 67 and
      83 % likelihood (Table SPM.2 of the Summary for Policymakers, Climate Change
      2021: The Physical Science Basis). Gt CO2, including land-use CO2. Approved
      line by line by governments.; Format: Table in PDF; Licensing: IPCC terms of
      use (reproduction with attribution); Geographic Coverage: World; Update Frequency:
      Assessment cycle (AR6 2021; AR7 expected 2028-2029); Date Last Updated: 2021-08-09;
      Updated by: IPCC'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Kausal interpolation of the IPCC remaining carbon budgets
    authority: Kausal Ltd
    url:
    description: "Linear interpolation of IPCC AR6 Table SPM.2 to a grid of 0.1 °C
      and 1 percentage point of likelihood, so that the model's sliders always find
      a row. The tabulated rows are unchanged; an interpolated row is approximate,
      because the budget is not linear in likelihood. Made by modules/fair-share/scripts/create_fair_share_budget.py.;
      Geographic Coverage: World; Update Frequency: On rebuild; Date Last Updated:
      2026-10-06; Updated by: Kausal"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  index_columns:
  - Year
